   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.24,
    "text": "do not buy this water for your babies. It is very dangerous. My name is Robert"
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 3.24,
    "end": 8.36,
    "text": "Love. I'm a neuroscientist. This water has fluoride. It says four babies. You do not"
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 8.36,
    "end": 14.2,
    "text": "want babies drinking water with fluoride. Why? Well, babies' brains, the blood"
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 14.2,
    "end": 18.24,
    "text": "brain barrier is not fully formed until six months. The blood brain barrier is not"
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 18.24,
    "end": 22.44,
    "text": "fully formed until six months of age. Fluoride therefore can cross the blood"
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 22.44,
    "end": 27.64,
    "text": "brain barrier. In infants, you do not want fluoride in the brain of a developing"
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 27.64,
    "end": 32.08,
    "text": "brain that's a really really bad idea. Some people believe that fluoride is good"
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 32.08,
    "end": 34.96,
    "text": "for your teeth if you put in the water that's basically been disproven and"
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 34.96,
    "end": 39.24,
    "text": "fluoride does a lot of damage to bones and teeth and potentially. The brain"
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 39.24,
    "end": 43.2,
    "text": "please do not get fluoridated water for babies. Babies need to be"
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 43.2,
    "end": 46.08,
    "text": "drinking breast milk otherwise they need to be drinking distilled water or"
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 46.08,
    "end": 50.28,
    "text": "reverse osmosis water with minerals added to it because babies brains are not"
   },
   {
    "id": "t13",
    "start": 50.28,
    "end": 55.24,
    "text": "able to protect themselves from the chemicals in the water."
   }
  ]
